0088f2"/></fig><fig id="f3-0080088" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Negotiated Interview</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="0080088f3"/></fig><table-wrap id="t1-0080088" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>CAGE Questionnaire</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">CAGE Questionnaire (In the last 12 months)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Have you ever felt you should Cut down on your drinking?</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Have people Annoyed you by criticizing your drinking?</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Have you ever felt bad or Guilty about your drinking?</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Have you ever had a drink first thing in the morning to &#x0201c;steady your nerves&#x0201d; or get rid of a hangover (Eye Opener)?</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tfn1-0080088"><p>JA Ewing &#x0201c;Detecting Alcoholism: The CAGE Questionnaire&#x0201d; <italic>JAMA</italic> 252: 1905&#x02013;1907, 1984.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-group></article>